      <section class="docs-hero" id="overview">
        <span class="docs-kicker">Patty Code docs</span>
        <h1>Install, configure, and run coding work locally.</h1>
        <p class="lede">This page is the concise website guide. It covers the normal path first, then links out to the full repo docs when you need every field or internal contract.</p>
        <div class="docs-path-grid" aria-label="Documentation overview">
          <a href="#install">
            <strong>New user path</strong>
            <span>Install, add an API key, open a repo, and start chatting.</span>
          </a>
          <a href="#permissions">
            <strong>Control work</strong>
            <span>Use approvals, sandboxing, Goal, and rewind to keep changes manageable.</span>
          </a>
          <a href="#extensions">
            <strong>Extend Patty Code</strong>
            <span>Build sidecars, Providers, UI, prompts, themes, and MCP tools.</span>
          </a>
          <a href="#configfile">
